export const KNOWLEDGE_BASE = "# Ari Thai Catering - assistant knowledge base\n\nGenerated by tools/build_kb.py from the website content. Do not edit by hand.\n\n## The business\n- Ari Thai Catering is the corporate and office catering arm of Ari - Thai\n  Street Food, a Thai restaurant at 6/158 Adelaide St, Brisbane City. Same\n  kitchen, same chefs.\n- We cater corporate and office events only: team lunches, working meetings,\n  board and client lunches, conferences, launches, staff celebrations and\n  end-of-year events.\n- We do NOT do weddings, private parties at home, or market stalls. If someone\n  asks about those, say so plainly and point them at the restaurant.\n- Service style is drop-off catering. The Ari Banquet package includes buffet\n  setup on arrival; Street Feast includes staffed service and pack-down.\n- Delivery is into Brisbane CBD and inner suburbs, included in the per-person\n  price. Anywhere further is quoted per event.\n- Quotes are returned within one business day of an enquiry.\n- Every quote is fixed and all-inclusive: food, serving equipment and delivery.\n- We invoice with an ABN and can quote against a purchase order number.\n- Final numbers are due 48 hours before delivery.\n- The restaurant is open seven days: Mon-Fri 9.00am-8.00pm, Sat-Sun\n  10.00am-6.00pm. Catering enquiries are answered during those hours.\n- Orders below 10 guests are better placed directly with the restaurant.\n\n## Contact\n- Enquiry form (the preferred route for any quote): https://ari-thaicatering.com.au/enquiry/\n- Email: arithaistreetfood@gmail.com\n- Phone: +61 452 643 155\n- Address: 6/158 Adelaide St, Brisbane City QLD 4000\n\n## Packages\nPrices are per person, include GST, and cover delivery into Brisbane CBD\nand inner suburbs. These are the only prices that may be quoted.\n\n### Street Lunch - $24 per person\nSuits: Everyday team lunches and working meetings\nOrdering: Minimum 10 guests \u00b7 drop-off\nIncludes:\n- 2 mains from the catering menu\n- Steamed jasmine rice\n- Fresh Thai side salad\n- Vegan and gluten-free versions at no extra cost\n- Serving tongs, plates, napkins and cutlery\n- Delivered hot and ready to serve\n\n### Ari Banquet - $34 per person\nSuits: Client lunches, board meetings and team celebrations\nOrdering: Minimum 15 guests \u00b7 drop-off with setup\nIncludes:\n- 3 mains from the catering menu\n- Entr\u00e9e platter \u2014 Moo Ping pork skewers, spring rolls and Thai fish cakes\n- Chef\u2019s curry of the day\n- Steamed jasmine rice and fresh Thai side salad\n- Mango sticky rice to finish\n- Chafing dishes to keep everything hot\n- We set the buffet up on arrival\n\n### Street Feast - $46 per person\nSuits: Conferences, launches and end-of-year events\nOrdering: Minimum 20 guests \u00b7 staffed service\nIncludes:\n- 4 mains plus a signature noodle dish\n- 2 entr\u00e9e platters and a Thai snack grazing board\n- Chef\u2019s curry of the day\n- Steamed jasmine rice and fresh Thai side salad\n- Mango sticky rice to finish\n- Ari\u2019s Thai iced tea station \u2014 Thai milk tea, lemon tea and O-Liang\n- Full setup, staffed service and pack-down\n\n## Included in every package, at no extra cost\n- Delivery into Brisbane CBD and inner suburbs\n- Chafing dishes or insulated carriers so food arrives hot\n- Serving tongs and spoons for every dish\n- Plates, bowls, napkins and cutlery\n- Vegan and gluten-free dishes at no surcharge, labelled separately\n- Menu cards listing every dish and its dietary tags\n- One tax invoice, PO number included if you need it\n\n## Add-ons (on top of a package price)\n- Entr\u00e9e platter \u2014 Moo Ping skewers, spring rolls, Thai fish cakes: $9 per person\n- Thai snack grazing board \u2014 crispy pork crackers, jerky, Nam Prik dips: $11 per person\n- Mango sticky rice: $7 per person\n- Ari\u2019s Thai iced tea station \u2014 milk tea, lemon tea, O-Liang: $6 per person\n- Extra main added to any package: $8 per person\n- Extra steamed jasmine rice: $3 per person\n- Staffed service \u2014 one server, up to 3 hours: $220 per server\n- Delivery beyond Brisbane CBD and inner suburbs: Quoted per event\n\n## Catering menu\nDishes are chosen by package rather than priced individually.\n\n### Mains & stir-fries\nWok-tossed to order. Choose your mains by package \u2014 two for Street Lunch, three for Banquet, four for Street Feast.\n- Pad Kra Pow on Rice\n- Thai Fried Rice\n- Spicy Basil Fried Rice\n- Tom Yum Fried Rice\n- Chili Jam Stir Fry on Rice\n- Garlic & Pepper Stir Fry on Rice\n- Red Curry Paste Stir Fried\n- Gai-Lan (Kana) Oyster Sauce over Rice\n- Chilli Salt Stir-Fry on Rice\n- Pad See Eiw\n- Pad Thai\n- Pad Kee Mao with Rice Noodles\n- Sen Kaeaw Salad \u2013 Kelp Noodle\n- Dry Sukiyaki Kelp Noodles\n- Tum Sen Lek \u2013 Thin Rice Noodle Salad\n\n### Entr\u00e9es & skewers\nServed on platters for the table. Included in the Banquet and Street Feast packages, or add to any order.\n- Set Moo Ping (Pork Skewers)\n- Thai Fish Cake (1 pc)\n- Spring Roll (1 pc)\n- Sour Pork (3 pcs)\n- Chicken Dim Sim (4 pcs)\n- Curry Puff\n- Thai Sausage\n\n### Vegan mains\nEvery package can be built fully vegan \u2014 no surcharge, no separate order.\n- Thai Fried Rice (Vegan)\n- Garlic and Pepper (Vegan)\n- Pad Ka Praw (Vegan)\n- Spicy Basil Fried Rice (Vegan)\n- Thai Salt and Chili (Vegan)\n- Chili Jam Stir Fried (Vegan)\n- Pad Kee Mao (Vegan)\n- Red Curry Stir Fried (Vegan)\n- Gai-Lan (Kana) Oyster Sauce (Vegan)\n- Sen Keaw Salad (Vegan)\n\n### Gluten-free mains\nPrepared with gluten-free sauces and labelled separately on delivery.\n- Thai Fried Rice (GF)\n- Garlic and Pepper (GF)\n- Pad Ka Praw (GF)\n- Spicy Basil Fried Rice (GF)\n- Thai Salt and Chili (GF)\n- Chili Jam Stir Fried (GF)\n- Red Curry Paste Stir Fried (GF)\n- Gai-Lan (Kana) Oyster Sauce (GF)\n- Pad Kee Mao (GF)\n- Sen Keaw Salad (GF)\n- Dry Sukiyaki (GF)\n- Tum Sen Lek Salad (GF)\n\n### Ari\u2019s Thai drinks\nOur iced tea station, brewed the Bangkok way. Add to any package.\n- Thai Milk Tea\n- Thai Black Tea\n- Thai Lemon Tea\n- Chrysanthemum Tea\n- Longan Juice\n- Pinky Milky\n- O-Liang Black Coffee\n- Thai Red Soda\n\n## Dietary\n- 10 vegan mains and 12 gluten-free mains to choose from.\n- No surcharge for a vegan or gluten-free version of a dish.\n- Dietary dishes are cooked separately, labelled, and served separately.\n- The kitchen handles nuts, shellfish, gluten, soy and sesame, so no dish\n  can be guaranteed free of traces. This is why allergy questions go to a\n  human every time.\n\n## Questions we are asked often\n**How much notice do you need?**\n24 hours for the Street Lunch package, and 48 hours for Banquet and Street Feast so we can prep the entr\u00e9es and desserts. If you\u2019re in a bind, call us \u2014 we can often make same-day work for smaller groups.\n\n**What is the minimum order?**\n10 guests for Street Lunch, 15 for Ari Banquet and 20 for Street Feast. Below 10 people you\u2019re usually better off ordering direct from the restaurant \u2014 happy to point you there.\n\n**Do you deliver outside the CBD?**\nDelivery into Brisbane CBD and the inner suburbs is included in the per-person price. Further out we\u2019ll quote the delivery separately \u2014 just put the address on the enquiry form.\n\n**How do you handle allergies?**\nTell us on the enquiry form and we\u2019ll build the menu around it. Dietary dishes are cooked separately and labelled clearly on delivery. Please note our kitchen handles nuts, shellfish, gluten, soy and sesame, so we can\u2019t guarantee a dish is free of traces.\n\n**Can we get an invoice for the finance team?**\nYes. We invoice with an ABN and can quote against a purchase order number. Add the PO number to the notes field and it will appear on the invoice.\n\n**What if our numbers change?**\nFinal numbers are due 48 hours before delivery. Small increases after that are usually fine \u2014 call and we\u2019ll do what we can.\n";
